menu "WS2812B Clock Environment Sensor"

    config DHT_ENABLE
        bool "DHT11 temperature and humidity sensor"
        default n

    config DHT_GPIO
        int "DHT11 data GPIO"
        depends on DHT_ENABLE
        range 0 33
        default 33
        help
            Must be output capable. The sensor's single-wire protocol needs the
            host to pull the line low to request a reading, so GPIO34-39 cannot
            be used -- they are input only on the ESP32, which is why the range
            here stops at 33.

            The line idles high and needs an external 4.7k-10k pull-up to the
            sensor's supply. Keep it away from the LED data runs.

    config DHT_INTERVAL_S
        int "Seconds between readings"
        depends on DHT_ENABLE
        range 2 3600
        default 30
        help
            A DHT11 updates roughly once a second at best and is specified to
            1 degree and 1 percent, so there is nothing to gain from reading it
            often. Room temperature does not move quickly.

    config DHT_RETRIES
        int "Attempts per reading"
        depends on DHT_ENABLE
        range 1 5
        default 3
        help
            A read that is interrupted mid-bit fails its checksum and is simply
            tried again, which is what makes this safe without masking
            interrupts.

endmenu
